{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00620",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 12.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "Hiya. I'm not really poorly or owt, it's just that the lady at the hospital said I should ask about my jabs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.78,
      "end_seconds": 23.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "Right, that's a sensible thing to ask. Which jabs did she have in mind, do you know? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.15,
      "end_seconds": 38.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "She said something about pneumonia and the flu one. And something for shingles, but I wasn't listening properly, to be honest. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.01,
      "end_seconds": 48.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "No bother, that's what I'm here for. Tell me first, how have you been lately, in yourself? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.56,
      "end_seconds": 58.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Champion, really. Better than I've been for a year or so. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.13,
      "end_seconds": 67.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Lovely. Have you had a temperature, or any cough, over the last few weeks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 72.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "No, nothing like that. No cough, no temperature."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.24,
      "end_seconds": 81.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "And any infections that took a long time to shift, chest, water works, anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.77,
      "end_seconds": 87.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "No, not since last winter. Nothing lately, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.31,
      "end_seconds": 96.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Good. I've got your notes here, so remind me about your long-term health."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.38,
      "end_seconds": 107.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "I've got lupus, they found it a few years back, and my kidneys aren't brilliant, chronic kidney disease they call it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.29,
      "end_seconds": 117.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "That's what I've got written, thank you. Do you smoke or drink at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.31,
      "end_seconds": 126.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "I don't drink, not for years now. Never been a smoker, either."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.84,
      "end_seconds": 136.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies, to medicines, foods, anything that's ever given you trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 142.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No. Not that I know of, anyway."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.48,
      "end_seconds": 150.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Grand. Let me get your numbers, then I'll have a listen to your chest. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.94,
      "end_seconds": 155.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Go on then. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.51,
      "end_seconds": 181.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 126 over 78, temperature 36.5, oxygen 99 percent, and breathing 15 times a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.17,
      "end_seconds": 188.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Is that all fine? You've gone quiet. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.77,
      "end_seconds": 198.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "Sorry, I was writing. All fine, yes. Take a deep breath in for me, and out. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.96,
      "end_seconds": 206.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "In and out. Do I need to take my top off? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.96,
      "end_seconds": 231.64,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "No, over the vest is fine. Chest is clear both sides, and I can't feel any swollen glands in your neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.98,
      "end_seconds": 236.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Is that good? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.7,
      "end_seconds": 253.4,
      "duration_seconds": 14.7,
      "text": "It's what I'd hoped for. Because lupus and your kidneys can make your immune system weaker, the vaccines matter more for you than for most. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.13,
      "end_seconds": 257.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "So can I have them today? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.18,
      "end_seconds": 271.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "I'll give you the pneumonia jab today, in your arm. The flu one, we'll do when the new batch comes in next month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.43,
      "end_seconds": 277.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "And the shingles one? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.99,
      "end_seconds": 295.95,
      "duration_seconds": 17.96,
      "text": "I'd like to check your blood first, to see how your immune system is doing, before we decide on that one. I'll send a blood test for your antibody levels."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.65,
      "end_seconds": 302.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Will I get a letter? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.15,
      "end_seconds": 319.43,
      "duration_seconds": 16.28,
      "text": "You'll get the result by text within a week. And I'd like you to come back in four weeks, so we can decide on the shingles jab together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.25,
      "end_seconds": 331.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Four weeks. I'll put it in my phone. Will the jab today make me poorly? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.06,
      "end_seconds": 341.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "A sore arm, maybe a bit tired tomorrow. If you get a high temperature or feel really unwell, ring us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.76,
      "end_seconds": 348.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Right you are. Thanks ever so much. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.15,
      "end_seconds": 354.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "You're welcome. Mind how you go. ~"
    }
  ]
}
